  "text": "\r\n\t\t Elections | Epping, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n\t\t\t Search \n     Links   \t\t\t \n     Government   \t\t\t \n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Employment  \t\t\t \n     How Do I...?   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Boat Registrations & Renewals \r\n\t\t\t Dog Licenses \r\n\t\t\t Elections \r\n\t\t\t Holiday Closings \r\n\t\t\t Marriage Licenses \r\n\t\t\t Motor Vehicle Registrations & Renewals \r\n\t\t\t Payment Types Accepted \r\n\t\t\t Proof of Residency \r\n\t\t\t State of NH - DMV Forms \r\n\t\t\t Vital Records Certificates \r\n\t\t\t Voter Registration \r\n\t\t\t Online Services \r\n\t\t\t Secretary of State - Elections Division \r\nHome \nDepartments \nTown Clerk \nElections \r\nElections\t\t \r\nARE YOU REGISTERED TO VOTE?  \nClick here to check whether you're registered to vote or check your party affiliation:  /DocumentCenter/View/1134 \nState/Federal Elections \nAbsentee Ballot Request Form for State Primary Election - September 8, 2026, a nd General Election - November 3, 2026:  \nClick here:  / DocumentCenter/View/1087 \nSAMPLE REPUBLICAN BALLOT:   /DocumentCenter/View/1131 \nSAMPLE DEMOCRAT BALLOT:  /DocumentCenter/View/1132 \nVoting Hours \nVoting hours are 7 am to 7 pm and take place at the Epping Middle/High School, 33 Prescott Road, Epping, in the O'Day gymnasium. \nAbsentee Ballots \nTown Election: not available \nServing in the Military or Living Outside the USA -  Voter Registration and Absentee Ballot Request (Federal Post Card Application) (PDF) \nCheck Status of Your Absentee Ballot -  NH Absentee Ballot Search \nAbsentee ballot request State/Federal Elections -  New Hampshire Secretary of State Website \nSupervisors of the Checklist \nSupervisors of the Checklist will be in session Thursday, August 27, 2026, at 6:00 pm till 6:30 pm, second floor of the town hall. Additions, corrections will be made at this time with proper paperwork. No change of party can be made at this time. This is for the upcoming Primary. \nSupervisors of the Checklist \nGrace Lavoie \nPam Holmes \nRobert Goodrich \nAny questions call Grace at 603-679-1016 \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \n\t\t\t Town Updates \r\n\t\t\t Boards & Commissions \n\t\t\t Departments \n\t\t\t Online Services \n\t\t\t Forms & Documents \nContact Us \r\nTown of Epping \r\n157 Main Street \r\nEpping, NH 03042 \r\nPhone:  603-679-5441 \r\nQuick Links \r\n         Epping Community Theater \n         Conservation Commission \n         Epping Library \n         Parks and Rec \n         Epping Schools \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nSite Links \r\n         Contact Us \n         Site Map \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
